@title New cabinet: a STEP file alone makes the enclosure, and a file that is not a STEP is refused in words
@area Cabinet
# Where the user finds it: Outline > New cabinet > Choose file... with no card picked.
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
click_text "New cabinet..." Button
wait 10
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/enclosure-parts.json
click_text "Choose file…" Button
wait 10
expect "not a STEP file"
shot a-refused
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/enclosure-step/TS-600x1800x500.stp
click_text "Choose file…" Button
wait 30
expect "600 x 1800 x 500 mm"
expect "(estimate)"
shot b-alone
check_layout
key Enter
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot c-cabinet-view
